function previewSlides(title,slides,actions=''){const d=openDialog(`<h2 class="dh">${esc(title)}</h2>${gallery('pvG',slides.map((s,i)=>({slide:s,label:ar(i+1)})))}<div class="acts" style="margin-top:12px">${actions}</div>`,{wide:1,focus:false});initGals(d);return d}

